<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOHN Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 John</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHN</para>
  <para style="mt2">Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">2 John chemajia hi tirton John in Christa inneisuonuk kum 90 pheiwei ileimajia eii. John apumtak in larik kamajiapa ka-eii tia malarmak, khawa rathuulla ama'n upa inkhat ka-eii tia alei inkoi. 2 John na nimu chong rakip ngaihi John dungjuiya Chongkahoi suungnga nimu chongngai khale innaitheiya nimu. Arei etheiya John chemajia ah nimuchu, Jisu'n inkhatli inkhat inriangru iti Jisu chongpeii kha ama niminriang halli achongpeii ngai nijui tina eii (2 John 1:5-6, John 15:9,10). John in John dungjuiya Chongkahoi khat-um chemajia inthum ngai 1 John, 2 John, 3 John hi ama'n Ephesus ah aomlaiya inmajia eii tia ingamna.</para>
  <para style="ip">John in hiwa chemajia hi inkadang numeisanu khat-um hiwa numeisanu sangai diang irilpi kha eii. Ama'n koisuok diang iril ka-ang eii. John in hiwa chemajia amajiana ajarchu koisuok diang masokna khat-um kadikmak ocha ngaidiang chongmakhaina eii.</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Hiwa chemajia hi John in tu-ngai sikme tia amalar halli chemajia karalaangsik ngaidiang minpaakna amalar <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Koisuok diang masokna khat-um kalokkhet chongpeii kha inmani diang minjet tharna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">1:4-6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Halli inmani diang kadikmak kaminchu ocha ngai jarra chongmakhaina <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">1:7-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Insuona chong <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">1:12-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1"/>Upa ka-eii—</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2JN 1:1">Kei'n, inthiangnga kiminriang Pathian ikadang numeisanu li ama sangai diang,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">numeisanu li ama sangai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hiwa hi koisuok khat-um ami ngai tina kha eii (ateelmun 4,5 ah nimu)</char></note> halli keibit emong takkha akadik kajet mirakip innum nangni kha innaminriang. <verse eid="2JN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2"/>Ajarchu akadik kha einidiang aom halli einidiang hektik kaboiya aomchaksik eii.<verse eid="2JN 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3"/>Apa Pathian khat-um Asapa Jisu Christa'n riangwai, minriang khat-um kadai ngaihi kadik li minriangna ah einita erase.<verse eid="2JN 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kadik li Minriang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4"/>Apa Pathian in einidiang inajuopeii chongpeii dungjuiya nangni ningsa lekkhat in kadik ah inringnga inom tihi kajetpha khan kei'n angtuk rokna kineime. <verse eid="2JN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5"/>Minriang kaom numeisanu, Atuun makheiya inphut eini rakip inkhatli inkhat inriangtui tia kei'n kanani. Hiwahi kei'n nangnadiang akathar chongpeii kimajia emak, takkha hiwa chongpeii hichu inphutna makheiya einidiang kaleiomsa kha-eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref> </char><verse eid="2JN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6"/>Minriang tinachu hi eii; eini rakip ama chongpeii ngaikha chongkajuiya niringsik eii. Inphutna makheiya nangni'n ning ijet ama chongpeii khachu, nangni'n inriangnga ningringsik eii.<verse eid="2JN 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7"/>Maleisei karil angjet manmasituol pumpuiya inleengnga inomjei, Jisu Christa kha miring taksa ah ajuo-inlar tia kazootmak miring rakipkha maleisei karil khat-um Christa Inhalpui mi in-eii. <verse eid="2JN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8"/>Khale inruoiya eini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">eini: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nang.</char></note> chuonleitho rakipkha mangmaknasik insingthei inlang omru, halli nangni'n chan kha kasip ah ningmusik eii.<verse eid="2JN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9"/>Atu ka-ang Christa minchunna makheiya kajuimak khat-um hiwahi rakaanna kasi mi kha, Pathian kalakeiluutmak mi in-eii. Halli atu ka-ang hiwa minchunna ah karing mi kha, Apa khat-um Asapa inni-reella kakeiluut mi kha in-eii. <verse eid="2JN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10"/>Halli atu ka-ang in hiwa minchunnahi choileiya nangnadiang aheiwa inchu, inmani kha nangni inna leikeiluut maru, halli “Kadai in naompuirase” iti chong hium tipimaru. <verse eid="2JN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11"/>Halli atu ka-ang in inmani kadon mi kha inmani kathamak chuontho khan ama innum ithopui suom ejei.<verse eid="2JN 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Chong ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12"/>Kei'n nangnidiang kimajiazoot khachu katamtak aom, takkha kei'n cheii li muk ah majiasik hi manuommong, khawa rathulla kei'n nangni ngai rakip najuopha ah meel li meel inmu ah inbiaksik tia inngamna kada, khawa e-inchu eini rokna hi pui tungjeite.<verse eid="2JN 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13"/>Niminriang numeisanu sangai'n<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Niminriang numeisanu sangai'n: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiwa kamajiapa koisuok suungnga kainchen mi lei echa tiya aminjet.</char></note> inmani inpaakna kha nangnidiang inhei mathuon.<verse eid="2JN 1:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1"/>
</usx>
